  "body": "The Best of the East Coast Bays: Vendor says MUST SELL! \r\n\r\nSought-after for its safe, community-focused atmosphere, Torbay is a standout favorite for families and professionals alike. From swimming and paddleboarding at sheltered Waiake Beach to exploring the coastal tracks and marine reserve at Long Bay, outdoor adventure is practically in your backyard-backed by sought-after local schooling and effortless links to Albany Mega Centre and the Northern Motorway.\r\n\r\nEnjoy effortless North Shore coastal living in this well-proportioned 110 sqm residential townhouse set on a generous half share of 1,998 sqm shared land footprint. Ideal for first-home buyers, downsizers, or investors, this home combines practicality, space, and convenience just minutes from Torbay Village, Waiake Beach, and Long Bay and the popular Glamorgan School with decile 10.   \r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n* Three Bedrooms\r\n* 110 sqm floor area \r\n* Half share of 1,998 sqm land area, \r\n* One Carport\r\n* Two extra car pads.\r\n\r\nMinutes drive to local beaches, coastal walkways, cafes, and top North Shore schools.\r\n\r\nCall/Text or Email Samantha Chaudhry or Jason Pham to arrange viewing or see you in our open homes.",
